    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget to <u>leave a review!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After his three children died, Augustus Blackrock hid his fortune so no one could have it. Is that his only secret? What happened to the Blackrock children?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE MANOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517980/extras/93b55702d541e58779d51e27e7ac51a0.poster.avif?t=1754315726\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517980/extras/93b55702d541e58779d51e27e7ac51a0.webm?t=1754315726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious Blackrock Manor and find the fortune hidden in it.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517980/extras/dbe63c6ff76152c6e1a5f4e16a1bf7e0.poster.avif?t=1754315726\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517980/extras/dbe63c6ff76152c6e1a5f4e16a1bf7e0.webm?t=1754315726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to observe and use reason to solve the eight escape rooms that form this mansion. Clues and hints are everywhere - keep an eye open!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND THE TRUTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517980/extras/1cc8d60a417eac9b480973224a06e73e.poster.avif?t=1754315726\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517980/extras/1cc8d60a417eac9b480973224a06e73e.webm?t=1754315726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what happened to the Blackrocks and where the fortune of Augustus is hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight escape rooms filled with puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intriguing story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget to <u>leave a review!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After his three children died, Augustus Blackrock hid his fortune so no one could have it. Is that his only secret? What happened to the Blackrock children?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE MANOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517980/extras/93b55702d541e58779d51e27e7ac51a0.poster.avif?t=1754315726\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517980/extras/93b55702d541e58779d51e27e7ac51a0.webm?t=1754315726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious Blackrock Manor and find the fortune hidden in it.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517980/extras/dbe63c6ff76152c6e1a5f4e16a1bf7e0.poster.avif?t=1754315726\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517980/extras/dbe63c6ff76152c6e1a5f4e16a1bf7e0.webm?t=1754315726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to observe and use reason to solve the eight escape rooms that form this mansion. Clues and hints are everywhere - keep an eye open!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND THE TRUTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517980/extras/1cc8d60a417eac9b480973224a06e73e.poster.avif?t=1754315726\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517980/extras/1cc8d60a417eac9b480973224a06e73e.webm?t=1754315726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what happened to the Blackrocks and where the fortune of Augustus is hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight escape rooms filled with puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intriguing story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
